      <doc xml:space="preserve"
           filename="Source/WebKit/WPEPlatform/wpe/headless/WPEToplevelHeadless.cpp"
           line="31">A headless [class@WPEPlatform.Toplevel] implementation.

[class@ToplevelHeadless] is the [class@WPEPlatform.Toplevel] implementation
used by [class@DisplayHeadless]. It has no native window and only tracks its
state, since there is no compositor or display to manage it.</doc>
      <source-position filename="Source/WebKit/WPEPlatform/wpe/headless/WPEToplevelHeadless.h"
